e_id":"U_kgDOD5UWlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261428887?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler","html_url":"https://github.com/capybutler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capybutler/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T11:18:45Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T11:18:45Z","body":"Specifications were split into two modules:\r\n- `usage-collector` that focuses on efficient writing of Usage Records\r\n- `usage-query` that focuses on retrieval of aggregated Usage Records\r\n\r\nBoth modules are extensible via plugins for specific storage backends. I've replaced PostgreSQL in specifications with TimescaleDB as that's what VendorV will be using for usage storage.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3958565152/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3959467652","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/619#issuecomment-3959467652","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/619","id":3959467652,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPaLyBs7sAK6E","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]",