ash\n# Search for workspace.dependencies section\ngrep -n \"workspace.dependencies\" Cargo.toml\n\n# Then check modkit-http configuration in that section\nsed -n '/^\\[workspace.dependencies\\]/,/^\\[/p' Cargo.toml | grep -A 3 \"modkit-http\"\n```\n\nRepository: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core\n\nLength of output: 473\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n#!/bin/bash\n# Check file-parser Cargo.toml for features configuration\ngrep -A 20 \"^\\[features\\]\" modules/file-parser/Cargo.toml\n\n# Also check if modkit-http is re-exported with features\ncat modules/file-parser/Cargo.toml | grep -A 5 \"modkit-http\"\n```\n\nRepository: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core\n\nLength of output: 176\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**Add `allow-insecure-http` feature to modkit-http dependency or guard the method call for release builds.**\n\nThe `allow_insecure_http()` method in modkit-http (lines 84-85) is conditionally compiled and only available when:\n- Running in debug mode (`debug_assertions`), OR\n- The `allow-insecure-http` feature flag is explicitly enabled\n\nCurrently, the modkit-http dependency in the workspace does not enable this feature flag, meaning the code will fail to compile in release builds. Either enable the feature flag in the workspace dependency declaration, or add an alternative code path that doesn't use this method in release builds.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@modules/file-parser/src/domain/service.rs` around lines 80 - 88, The call to\nbuilder.allow_insecure_http() is conditionally compiled in modkit-http and will\nfail in release builds; fix by either enabling the allow-insecure-http feature\non the modkit-http workspace dependency, or wrap the call in a compile-time\nguard so it’s only invoked when available (e.g., use cfg_attr/cfg to check\ndebug_assertions or the feature flag) — modify the block around\nHttpClient::builder(), the conditional branch that checks\nconfig.allow_insecure_http, and the builder.allow_insecure_http() invocation so\nthe method is only called when the modkit-http feature is enabled (or remove the\ncall for release builds) while leaving the rest of the\nHttpClient::builder()/.build()? flow intact.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:ocelot -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commit 0fac50d","created_at":"2026-02-13T13:51:04Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T13:51:20Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/609#discussion_r2804329009","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/609","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2804329009"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/609#discussion_r2804329009"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/609"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2804329009/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":80,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":88,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":33,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2804329658","pull_request_review_id":3797406693,"id":2804329658,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6nJqy6","diff_hunk":"@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@ COPY rust-toolchain.toml ./\n \n # Copy all workspace members\n COPY apps/hyperspot-server ./apps/hyperspot-server\n+COPY apps/gts-docs-validator ./apps/gts-docs-validator","path":"testing/docker/hyperspot.Dockerfile","commit_id":"ef8414697b82b3f0f4649c9c4b8872864b521823","original_commit_id":"01b98b60ea2712de68cd3651adbbf88a2b037963","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserc