hind an opt-in flag or environment\ntoggle and ensure the trace exporter endpoint is locked down; update the\nrecord_headers entry (the record_headers list) accordingly and add a brief\ncomment noting why authorization is excluded.\n\nIn `@modules/file-parser/src/domain/service.rs`:\n- Around line 80-88: The call to builder.allow_insecure_http() is conditionally\ncompiled in modkit-http and will fail in release builds; fix by either enabling\nthe allow-insecure-http feature on the modkit-http workspace dependency, or wrap\nthe call in a compile-time guard so it’s only invoked when available (e.g., use\ncfg_attr/cfg to check debug_assertions or the feature flag) — modify the block\naround HttpClient::builder(), the conditional branch that checks\nconfig.allow_insecure_http, and the builder.allow_insecure_http() invocation so\nthe method is only called when the modkit-http feature is enabled (or remove the\ncall for release builds) while leaving the rest of the\nHttpClient::builder()/.build()? flow intact.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit for review status -->","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/609#pullrequestreview-3797405947","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/609","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/609#pullrequestreview-3797405947"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/609"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-13T13:51:05Z","commit_id":"ef8414697b82b3f0f4649c9c4b8872864b521823"}]},{"source_pr_number":606,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/606","source_state":"closed","source_author":"pr0tey","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #606] (docs) prd for model registry","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"spec-model-registy","