arately and be nested under a configurable API prefix.\n\n* **Configuration**\n  * New configurable API prefix (prefix_path) with default \"/cf\".\n  * Default OpenAPI URL updated to include the API prefix (/cf/openapi.json).\n\n* **Updates**\n  * Docs, OpenAPI, validation, MIME and rate-limit middleware now respect the configured prefix.\n  * Added utility to compose prefixed routes.\n\n* **Tests / Chores**\n  * Unit, integration and e2e tests and default test base URL updated to use the prefixed routing paths.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-02-13T07:12:20Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T08:34:43Z","closed_at":"2026-02-27T08:34:43Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1b167fb4c3c58fa33d0cb77796fce6c8dee3eb48","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/602/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/602/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/602/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/7700c01329592d1abc48d951aced4bc0752443ce","head":{"label":"dominic1988-lgtm:460v3","ref":"460v3","sha":"7700c01329592d1abc48d951aced4bc0752443ce","user":{"login":"dominic1988-lgtm","id":206866400,"node_id":"U_kgDODFSH4A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206866400?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominic1988-lgtm","html_url":"https://github.com/dominic1988-lgtm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominic1988-lgtm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominic1988-lgtm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominic1988-lgtm/gists{/gist_id}","starr