 MODIFIED requirements, paste the complete updated requirement block (header + all scenarios) with behavior changes; the archiver replaces the entire requirement\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-10T18:54:33.294Z\nLearning: Applies to modules/system/types-registry/openspec/openspec/changes/**/specs/**/*.md : In spec delta files, use ADDED for new orthogonal capabilities, MODIFIED for behavior changes of existing requirements, and RENAMED for name-only changes\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-10T18:54:47.115Z\nLearning: Applies to modules/system/types-registry/openspec/openspec/changes/*/proposal.md : In `proposal.md`, include sections: Why (1-2 sentences on problem/opportunity), What Changes (bullet list with breaking changes marked **BREAKING**), and Impact (affected specs and code)\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-10T18:54:47.115Z\nLearning: Applies to modules/system/types-registry/openspec/openspec/changes/*/specs/**/spec.md : In spec delta files under `changes/[change-id]/specs/`, use `## ADDED Requirements`, `## MODIFIED Requirements`, `## REMOVED Requirements`, and `## RENAMED Requirements` sections\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-10T18:54:47.115Z\nLearning: Applies to modules/system/types-registry/openspec/openspec/changes/*/design.md : In `design.md`, include sections: Context (background/constraints/stakeholders), Goals/Non-Goals, Decisions (what and why with alternatives), Risks/Trade-offs, Migration Plan, and Open Questions\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo