tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Some comments are outside the diff and can’t be posted inline due to platform limitations.\n> \n> \n> \n> <details>\n> <summary>⚠️ Outside diff range comments (2)</summary><blockquote>\n> \n> <details>\n> <summary>modules/system/tenant-resolver/tenant-resolver-sdk/src/api.rs (1)</summary><blockquote>\n> \n> `16-40`: _⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_\n> \n> **Fix double space in doc text.**\n> \n> Line 39 has a double space (“module  does”). Small doc polish.\n> \n> <details>\n> <summary>Suggested fix</summary>\n> \n> ```diff\n> -/// The module  does **not** perform its own access-control checks.\n> +/// The module does **not** perform its own access-control checks.\n> ```\n> </details>\n> \n> </blockquote></details>\n> <details>\n> <summary>docs/MODKIT_PLUGINS.md (1)</summary><blockquote>\n> \n> `741-766`: _⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_\n> \n> **Init-order guarantee is overstated.**\n> \n> Without an explicit dependency on plugins, the main module is not guaranteed to initialize last; discovery should be described as lazy/independent.\n> \n> <details>\n> <summary>Proposed wording tweak</summary>\n> \n> ```diff\n> -3. Main module initializes last and can discover all available plugins\n> +3. Main module can initialize independently; lazy discovery will pick up plugins once they register\n> ```\n> </details>\n> \n> </blockquote></details>\n> \n> </blockquote></details>\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit for review status -->","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://gi