Minor_\n> \n> **Inconsistent pattern naming with later reference.**\n> \n> The heading still uses \"Gateway + Plugins Pattern\", but line 3186 refers to this as \"Module + Plugins pattern\". According to the PR objectives to replace \"gateway\" terminology with \"module\" terminology, this should be updated to match the terminology used in line 3186.\n> \n> \n> \n> <details>\n> <summary>📝 Proposed fix for consistency</summary>\n> \n> ```diff\n> -### Step 14: Plugin-Based Modules (Gateway + Plugins Pattern)\n> +### Step 14: Plugin-Based Modules (Module + Plugins Pattern)\n> ```\n> \n> </details>\n> \n> ---\n> \n> `2816-2876`: _⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_\n> \n> **Incomplete terminology migration in Plugin architecture section.**\n> \n> This section contains multiple instances of \"gateway\" terminology that should be updated according to the PR objectives:\n> \n> 1. **Line 2821**: Diagram header uses \"GATEWAY MODULE\" → should be \"MAIN MODULE\" or \"MODULE WITH PLUGINS\"\n> 2. **Lines 2835-2842**: Crate structure uses placeholders `<gateway-name>` and `<gateway>-sdk` → should use `<module>` and `<module>-sdk` for consistency with line 2844\n> 3. **Line 2868**: Type name example uses `<Module>GatewayClient` → should be `<Module>Client` (consistent with line 3117 which correctly uses `TenantResolverClient`)\n> 4. **Lines 2873, 2876**: Comments refer to \"gateway\" → should say \"main module\" or \"module with plugins\"\n> \n> \n> \n> <details>\n> <summary>📝 Proposed fixes for complete terminology migration</summary>\n> \n> **Fix diagram header:**\n> ```diff\n>  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n> -│                            GATEWAY MODULE                          │\n> +│                       MAIN MODULE (with plugins)                   │\n>  │  • Exposes public API (REST + ClientHub)                           │\n> ```\n> \n> **Fix crate structure placeholders:**\n> ```diff\n> -modules/<gateway-name>/\n> -├── <gateway>-sdk/              # SDK: API traits, models, errors, GTS types\n> +modules/<module-name>/\n> +├── <module>-sdk/              # SDK: API traits, models, errors, GTS types\n> ```\n> \n> **Fix type name example:**\n> ```diff\n> -**Rule:** Mirror `modules/system/tenant_resolver/tenant_resolver-sdk`:\n> -\n> -- `src/api.rs` defines `<Module>GatewayClient`\n> +- `src/api.rs` defines `<Module>Client`\n> ```\n> \n> **Fix comments:**\n> ```diff\n> -// <gateway>-sdk/src/api.rs\n> +// <module>-sdk/src/api.rs\n>  \n> -/// Public API — exposed by gateway, consumed by other modules\n> -#[async_trait]\n> -pub trait MyModuleGatewayClient: Send + Sync {\n> +/// Public API — exposed by main module, consumed by other modules\n> +pub trait MyModuleClient: Send + Sync {\n>      async fn do_work(&self, ctx: &SecurityContext, input: Input) -> Result<Output, MyError>;\n>  }\n>  \n> -// <gateway>-sdk/src/plugin_api.rs\n> +// <module>-sdk/src/plugin_api.rs\n>  \n> -/// Plugin API — implemented by plugins, called by gateway\n> +/// Plugin API — implemented by plugins, called by main module\n> ```\n> \n> </details>\n> \n> </blockquote></details>\n> \n> </blockquote></details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Fix all issues with AI agents</summary>\n\n````\nIn `@docs/MODKIT_PLUGINS.md`:\n- Line 29: The fenced code block in the docs/MODKIT_PLUGINS.md is missing a\nlanguage identifier which triggers MD040; update the opening backtick fence (the\ntriple ``` block) to include a language token (e.g., change ``` to ```text or\nanother appropriate language) so the linter recognizes the block and the warning\nis resolved.\n````\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit for review status -->","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/597#pullrequestreview-3796636219","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/597","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/597#pullrequestreview-3796636219"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/597"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-13T10:57:44Z","commit_id":"fee22d869ebf5ab75dc2d4133d07d3bd3e4f905e"}]},{"source_pr_number":595,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/595","source_state":"closed","source_author":"github-actions[bot]","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #595] chore: release","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"release-plz-2026-02-12T18-50-46Z","pr_head_sha":"1c5017c234d098bd8282909de001985cab0bc11a","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"cyberfabric","pr_from_fork":0,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/595","id":3277655775,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPaLyBs7DXQ7f","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/595","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/595.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/595.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/595","number":595,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore: release","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `cf-modkit-security`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-modkit-transport-grpc`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-modkit-db-macros`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-modkit-errors`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-modkit-errors-macro`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-modkit-odata`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-modkit-utils`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-modkit-db`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-modkit-macros`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-modkit-odata-macros`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-modkit-sdk`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-modkit`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-authn-resolver-sdk`: 0.1.0\n* `cf-modkit-http`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-api-gateway`: 0.1.2 -> 0.1.3\n* `cf-types-registry-sdk`: 0.1.2 -> 0.1.3\n* `cf-authn-resolver`: 0.1.0\n* `cf-authz-resolver-sdk`: 0.1.0\n* `cf-authz-resolver`: 0.1.0\n* `cf-file-parser`: 0.1.2 -> 0.1.3\n* `cf-modkit-node-info`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-single-tenant-tr-plugin`: 0.1.1 -> 0.1.2\n* `cf-static-authn-plugin`: 0.1.0\n* `cf-static-authz-plugin`: 0.1.0\n* `cf-static-tr-plugin`: 0.1.1 -> 0.1.2\n* `cf-tenant-resolver`: 0.1.2 -> 0.1.3\n* `types-sdk`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-types-registry`: 0.1.2 -> 0.1.3\n* `cf-modkit-auth`: 0.2.8 -> 0.2.9\n* `cf-system-sdk-directory`: 0.1.10 -> 0.1.11\n* `cf-system-sdks`: 0.1.10 -> 0.1.11\n* `cf-grpc-hub`: 0.1.2 -> 0.1.3\n* `cf-module-orchestrator`: 0.1.2 -> 0.1.3\n* `cf-nodes-registry-sdk`: 0.1.2 -> 0.1.3\n* `cf-nodes-registry`: 0.1.2 -> 0.1.3\n* `cf-tenant-resolver-sdk`: 0.1.3 -> 0.1.4\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n## `cf-modkit`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.2.9](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/compare/cf-modkit-v0.2.8...cf-modkit-v0.2.9) - 2026-02-17\n\n### Added\n\n- implement authentication and authorization resolvers (by @aviator5) - #612\n\n### Fixed\n\n- show colors on supported windows terminal (by @lansfy) - #590\n\n### Other\n\n- Merge pull request #612 from aviator5/authn-authz-impl-p1 (by @MikeFalcon77) - #612\n- *(plugins)* extract shared choose_plugin_instance into modkit::plugins (by @aviator5)\n- enable let_underscore_must_use because coderabbitai check it (by @lansfy) - #616\n- Merge pull request #594 from lansfy/fix_random_fail_in_test (by @MikeFalcon77) - #594\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @MikeFalcon77\n* @aviator5\n* @lansfy\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-authn-resolver-sdk`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.0](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-authn-resolver-sdk-v0.1.0) - 2026-02-17\n\n### Added\n\n- implement authentication and authorization resolvers (by @aviator5) - #612\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @aviator5\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-modkit-http`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.2.9](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/compare/cf-modkit-http-v0.2.8...cf-modkit-http-v0.2.9) - 2026-02-17\n\n### Other\n\n- enable let_underscore_must_use because coderabbitai check it (by @lansfy) - #616\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @lansfy\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n## `cf-authn-resolver`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.0](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-authn-resolver-v0.1.0) - 2026-02-17\n\n### Added\n\n- implement authentication and authorization resolvers (by @aviator5) - #612\n\n### Fixed\n\n- validate GTS registration results instead of silently discarding them (by @aviator5) - #612\n\n### Other\n\n- *(plugins)* extract shared choose_plugin_instance into modkit::plugins (by @aviator5)\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @aviator5\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-authz-resolver-sdk`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.0](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-authz-resolver-sdk-v0.1.0) - 2026-02-17\n\n### Added\n\n- implement authentication and authorization resolvers (by @aviator5) - #612\n\n### Other\n\n- *(plugins)* extract shared choose_plugin_instance into modkit::plugins (by @aviator5)\n\n### Security\n\n- *(auth)* require subject_id and subject_tenant_id in SecurityContext builder (by @aviator5)\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @aviator5\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-authz-resolver`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.0](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-authz-resolver-v0.1.0) - 2026-02-17\n\n### Added\n\n- implement authentication and authorization resolvers (by @aviator5) - #612\n\n### Fixed\n\n- validate GTS registration results instead of silently discarding them (by @aviator5) - #612\n\n### Other\n\n- *(plugins)* extract shared choose_plugin_instance into modkit::plugins (by @aviator5)\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @aviator5\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n\n## `cf-static-authn-plugin`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.0](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-static-authn-plugin-v0.1.0) - 2026-02-17\n\n### Added\n\n- implement authentication and authorization resolvers (by @aviator5) - #612\n\n### Fixed\n\n- validate GTS registration results instead of silently discarding them (by @aviator5) - #612\n\n### Other\n\n- *(config)* streamline quickstart.yaml auth configuration (by @aviator5)\n- *(plugins)* extract shared choose_plugin_instance into modkit::plugins (by @aviator5)\n\n### Security\n\n- *(auth)* require subject_id and subject_tenant_id in SecurityContext builder (by @aviator5)\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @aviator5\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-static-authz-plugin`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.0](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-static-authz-plugin-v0.1.0) - 2026-02-17\n\n### Added\n\n- implement authentication and authorization resolvers (by @aviator5) - #612\n\n### Fixed\n\n- validate GTS registration results instead of silently discarding them (by @aviator5) - #612\n\n### Other\n\n- *(plugins)* extract shared choose_plugin_instance into modkit::plugins (by @aviator5)\n\n### Security\n\n- *(authz)* deny access on nil/missing tenant in static-authz-plugin (by @aviator5)\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @aviator5\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n## `types-sdk`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.2.9](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/compare/types-sdk-v0.2.8...types-sdk-v0.2.9) - 2026-02-17\n\n### Other\n\n- update Cargo.toml dependencies\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-02-12T18:50:49Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T23:43:01Z","closed_at":"2026-02-17T23:43:01Z","merged_at":"2026-02-17T23:43:01Z","merge_commit_sha":"4c5a90ab87be0d7ea85e3142c3a285c878cada7c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":10069720360,"node_id":"LA_kwDOPaLyBs8AAAACWDO9KA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/labels/release-plz","name":"release-plz","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/595/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/595/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/595/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/1c5017c234d098bd8282909de001985cab0bc11a","head":{"label":"cyberfabric:release-plz-2026-02-12T18-50-46Z","ref":"release-plz-2026-02-12T18-50-46Z","sha":"1c5017c234d098bd8282909de001985cab0bc11a","user":{"login":"cyberfabric","id":249082402,"node_id":"O_kgDODtiyIg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/249082402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberfabric","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberfabric/followers","following_url":"