ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Restructured continuous integration workflows for clearer job organization and reduced duplication.\n  * Removed deprecated workflow jobs and consolidated test configurations.\n  * Simplified linting and build steps to streamline CI execution.\n\n* **Tests**\n  * Expanded integration test matrix to include multiple database backends (Postgres, MySQL, SQLite) for broader coverage.\n  * Restored end-to-end pilot test block.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-02-12T10:26:11Z","updated_at":"2026-02-12T13:49:00Z","closed_at":"2026-02-12T13:49:00Z","merged_at":"2026-02-12T13:48:59Z","merge_commit_sha":"2b22c3989c85c0af5c21e31cb2cc7d64d219692e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/585/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/585/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/585/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/323ea657a90a1209ca882ab02c30c90f5a7e0408","head":{"label":"Bechma:fix-once-for-all","ref":"fix-once-for-all","sha":"323ea657a90a1209ca882ab02c30c90f5a7e0408","user":{"login":"Bechma","id":19294519,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5Mjk0NTE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19294519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma","html_url":"https://github.com/Bechma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/starred{/owner}{/