tion\", adds multi-backend integration test steps (sqlite, Postgres, MySQL), removes sccache stats and some caching steps, and adjusts dylint steps and cypilot blocks.\n\n## Changes\n\n|Cohort / File(s)|Summary|\n|---|---|\n|**CI workflow** <br> ` .github/workflows/ci.yml`|Renames/consolidates test job to `integration`, moves RUSTFLAGS to job-level, removes per-step RUSTFLAGS, adds integration test steps for `users_info` (Postgres) and `modkit-db` (sqlite, Postgres, MySQL), updates cache key to `integration-stable`, removes sccache stats and Cargo/target caching, simplifies dylint steps, restores cypilot block.|\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 3 (Moderate) | ⏱️ ~20 minutes\n\n## Possibly related issues\n\n- **cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core#586**: Same CI workflow file modified to simplify job configurations, move RUSTFLAGS, and restructure integration/test jobs.\n\n## Possibly related PRs\n\n- **cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core#514**: Overlapping changes to `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (job renaming, RUSTFLAGS relocation, caching and dylint adjustments).\n\n## Suggested reviewers\n\n- MikeFalcon77\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰 With twitching nose I hop and cheer,  \n> Jobs converge, the pipeline’s clear,  \n> Flags set high and caches trimmed,  \n> Integration tests now neatly trimmed,  \n> A carrot toast to CI near! 🥕\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🚥 Pre-merge checks | ✅ 3</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ Passed checks (3 passed)</summary>\n\n|     Check name     | Status   | Explanation                                                                                                                                                                         |\n| :----------------: | :------- | :---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n|  Description Check | ✅ 