":{"login":"dominic1988-lgtm","id":206866400,"node_id":"U_kgDODFSH4A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206866400?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominic1988-lgtm","html_url":"https://github.com/dominic1988-lgtm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominic1988-lgtm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominic1988-lgtm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominic1988-lgtm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominic1988-lgtm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominic1988-lgtm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominic1988-lgtm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominic1988-lgtm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominic1988-lgtm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominic1988-lgtm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * API routes and OpenAPI now served under the /chat prefix; module-provided routes are registered separately and composed into the final API (OpenAPI endpoint moved to /chat/openapi.json).\n\n* **Bug Fixes / Behavior**\n  * License, MIME and rate-limit middlewares now use suffix-based longest-match path matching for more flexible and accurate endpoint matching.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Tests and CI defaults updated to reflect the new /chat routing and endpoint locations.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-02-12T07:37:39Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T07:12:40Z","closed_at":"2026-02-13T07:12:40Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9d514a475dd6290752309d41f9cf12483775ee59","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"