position":7,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2795721342","pull_request_review_id":3787680180,"id":2795721342,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6mo1J-","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,127 @@\n+# PR Review with Cypilot\n+\n+This project uses **Cypilot** for AI-powered PR reviews and status reports.\n+\n+## Quick Start\n+\n+Cyber Fabric has intergrated Cypilot autonation for PR review assistance. Use any supported agent","path":"docs/pr-review/README.md","commit_id":"9bb43842cab8a510e9a4fedeaf16a07005eb0cfa","original_commit_id":"41627030c24c3d3cc618b3df0485a5a3b053c39e","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`@Artifizer`, thank you for fixing the typos! 🎉\n\n<!-- <review_comment_addressed> -->\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧠 Learnings used</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: Artifizer\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 565\nFile: .cypilot-adapter/pr-review.json:1-37\nTimestamp: 2026-02-11T19:23:56.158Z\nLearning: The `.cypilot` directory in cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core is a Git submodule pointing to https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-pilot. It contains PR review scripts, prompts, templates, and workflows referenced by `.cypilot-adapter/pr-review.json`. Paths like `.cypilot/skills/scripts/pr.py`, `.cypilot/prompts/pr/*.md`, and `.cypilot/templates/pr/` exist in the submodule, not the main repository.\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: .cursor/rules/cypilot-pr-status.mdc:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-11T19:23:35.535Z\nLearning: Always open and follow the PR status workflow defined in `../../.cypilot/workflows/pr-status.md` when generating status reports for GitHub PRs with severity assessment\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: .github/copilot-instructions.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-09T15:09:24.501Z\nLearning: ALWAYS open and follow the Cypilot skill documentation at `../.cypilot/skills/cypilot/SKILL.md`\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: modules/simple-user-settings/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-10T18:53:52.396Z\nLearning: Use `@/openspec/AGENTS.md` to learn how to create and apply change proposals, spec format and conventions, and project structure and guidelines\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-10T18:54:14.400Z\nLearning: Use `@/openspec/AGENTS.md` to learn about how to create and apply change proposals, spec format and conventions, and project structure and guidelines\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: .cursor/rules/cypilot.mdc:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-09T15:09:27.324Z\nLearning: ALWAYS open and follow `../../.cypilot/skills/cypilot/SKILL.md`\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: modules/simple-user-settings/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-10T18:53:52.396Z\nLearning: Always open `@/openspec/AGENTS.md` when the request introduces new capabilities, breaking changes, architecture shifts, or big performance/security work\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: modules/simple-user-settings/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-10T18:54:10.527Z\nLearning: Applies to modules/simple-user-settings/openspec/openspec/changes/*/proposal.md : Create a `proposal.md` file that includes: (1) a 'Why' section explaining the problem/opportunity in 1-2 sentences, (2) a 'What Changes' section with bullet points of changes and marking breaking changes as **BREAKING**, and (3) an 'Impact' section listing affected specs and code\n```\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-02-11T21:56:43Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T21:56:43Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/571#discussion_r2795721342","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/571","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2795721342"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/571#discussion_r2795721342"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/571"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2795721342/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":7,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2795693761,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":7,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2795728889","pull_request_review_id":3787687817,"id":27957