ot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `cf-modkit-security`: 0.2.2 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-modkit-transport-grpc`: 0.2.5 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-system-sdk-directory`: 0.1.7 -> 0.1.8\n* `cf-system-sdks`: 0.1.7 -> 0.1.8\n* `cf-modkit-db-macros`: 0.2.5 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-modkit-errors`: 0.2.5 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-modkit-errors-macro`: 0.2.5 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-modkit-odata`: 0.2.5 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-modkit-utils`: 0.2.2 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-modkit-db`: 0.2.1 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-modkit-macros`: 0.2.1 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-modkit-odata-macros`: 0.2.5 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-modkit-sdk`: 0.2.5 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-modkit`: 0.2.1 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-modkit-http`: 0.2.5 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-modkit-auth`: 0.2.1 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-api-gateway`: 0.1.1 -> 0.1.2\n* `cf-grpc-hub`: 0.1.1 -> 0.1.2\n* `cf-types-registry-sdk`: 0.1.1 -> 0.1.2\n* `types-sdk`: 0.2.5 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-file-parser`: 0.1.1 -> 0.1.2\n* `cf-module-orchestrator`: 0.1.1 -> 0.1.2\n* `cf-modkit-node-info`: 0.2.0 -> 0.2.6\n* `cf-nodes-registry-sdk`: 0.1.1 -> 0.1.2\n* `cf-nodes-registry`: 0.1.1 -> 0.1.2\n* `cf-tenant-resolver-sdk`: 0.1.2 -> 0.1.3\n* `cf-single-tenant-tr-plugin`: 0.1.1 -> 0.1.2\n* `cf-static-tr-plugin`: 0.1.1 -> 0.1.2\n* `cf-tenant-resolver-gw`: 0.1.1 -> 0.1.2\n* `cf-types-registry`: 0.1.1 -> 0.1.2\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n\n\n## `cf-system-sdk-directory`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.8](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/compare/cf-system-sdk-directory-v0.1.7...cf-system-sdk-directory-v0.1.8) - 2026-02-11\n\n### Other\n\n- release (by @github-actions[bot]) - #546\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @github-actions[bot]\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-system-sdks`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.8](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/compare/cf-system-sdks-v0.1.7...cf-system-sdks-v0.1.8) - 2026-02-11\n\n### Other\n\n- release (by @github-actions[bot]) - #546\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @github-actions[bot]\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n## `cf-modkit`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.2.6](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/compare/cf-modkit-v0.2.1...cf-modkit-v0.2.6) - 2026-02-11\n\n### Added\n\n- *(modkit-http)* introduce HttpClient (hyper+tower), replace reqwest and harden JWKS handling (by @MikeFalcon77)\n\n### Fixed\n\n- update module names to use kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n- *(dylint/de1301)* allow proc-macro impl methods via visit_assoc_item (by @Artifizer)\n\n### Other\n\n- Merge branch 'main' into shutdown-nl (by @Artifizer) - #475\n- Merge branch 'main' into rescue-docs-standards (by @Artifizer) - #478\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @yoskini\n* @MikeFalcon77\n* @Artifizer\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-modkit-http`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.2.6](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/compare/cf-modkit-http-v0.2.5...cf-modkit-http-v0.2.6) - 2026-02-11\n\n### Added\n\n- *(modkit-auth)* add outbound OAuth2 client-credentials token + bearer auth layer (by @MikeFalcon77)\n- *(modkit-http)* introduce HttpClient (hyper+tower), replace reqwest and harden JWKS handling (by @MikeFalcon77)\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @MikeFalcon77\n</blockquote>\n\n\n## `cf-api-gateway`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.2](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/compare/cf-api-gateway-v0.1.1...cf-api-gateway-v0.1.2) - 2026-02-11\n\n### Fixed\n\n- update module names to use kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @yoskini\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-grpc-hub`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.2](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/compare/cf-grpc-hub-v0.1.1...