n- New PR review workflow with LLM-powered analysis and configurable checklists\r\n- New PR status workflow with severity assessment and comment audit\r\n- Integration support for Claude, Cursor, and Windsurf IDEs\r\n- Enhanced artifact rules for ADR, DECOMPOSITION, DESIGN, FEATURE, and PRD\r\n- GitHub Actions prompts for automated PR processing\r\n- Updated documentation checklists and agent configurations\r\n\r\nSee docs/pr-review/README.md\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * LLM-powered PR review with configurable prompts and checklists\n  * PR status reports with severity assessment and resolved-comment audit\n  * Per-repo PR review configuration and workflow integration for tailored behavior\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * New and expanded review checklists (Requirements, Design, ADR, Coding) and guidance tying checklists into the PR workflow\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-02-11T18:21:37Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T19:24:06Z","closed_at":"2026-02-11T19:23:20Z","merged_at":"2026-02-11T19:23:20Z","merge_commit_sha":"dde089ae9ab4fc7a1034a49b769e7c0b160adde6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"ainetx","id":244471386,"node_id":"U_kgDODpJWWg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244471386?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx","html_url":"https://github.com/ainetx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.c