e (YAML null), which can break\nrule parsing/loading and prevent the rule from applying.\n</pre>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Agent Prompt</strong></summary>\n\n```\n### Issue description\n`.cursor/rules/cypilot-pr-status.mdc` has an empty `globs:` field in YAML front matter. This can break Cursor’s rule parsing or cause the rule to be ignored.\n\n### Issue Context\nExisting Cursor rule files in this repo don’t use `globs` at all.\n\n### Fix Focus Areas\n- .cursor/rules/cypilot-pr-status.mdc[1-5]\n```\n\n<code>ⓘ Copy this prompt and use it to remediate the issue with your preferred AI generation tools</code>\n</details>","created_at":"2026-02-11T18:27:38Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T18:27:38Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/565#discussion_r2794814647","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/565","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2794814647"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/565#discussion_r2794814647"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/565"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2794814647/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":1,"original_start_line":1,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":5,"original_line":5,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2794981230","pull_request_review_id":3786732592,"id":2794981230,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6mmAdu","diff_hunk":"@@ -128,7 +129,35 @@ Generate draft content for missing CRITICAL items.\n \n ---\n \n+## PR Review Integration\n+\n+These checklists are integrated with the Cypilot PR review workflow. When reviewing PRs:\n+\n+- **PRD PRs**: Use `PR