, template compliance, and overlap with existing ADRs.\",\n+      \"promptFile\": \".cypilot/prompts/pr/adr-review.md\",\n+      \"checklist\": \"docs/checklists/ADR.md\",\n+      \"template\": \"docs/spec-templates/ADR.md\",\n+      \"existing_artifacts\": \"docs/adrs/\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"name\": \"PRD Review\",\n+      \"description\": \"Review for PRs that add or change PRD/requirements documents. Evaluates completeness, testability, traceability, and industry alignment.\",\n+      \"promptFile\": \".cypilot/prompts/pr/prd-review.md\",\n+      \"checklist\": \"docs/checklists/PRD.md\",\n+      \"template\": \"docs/spec-templates/PRD.md\",\n+      \"project_domain\": \"docs/ARCHITECTURE_MANIFEST.md\",\n+      \"existing_artifacts\": \"docs/prds/\"","path":".cypilot-adapter/pr-review.json","commit_id":"1015089615b358bed96ea9838cb338de769d4bd2","original_commit_id":"1015089615b358bed96ea9838cb338de769d4bd2","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🔴 Critical_\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧩 Analysis chain</summary>\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n#!/bin/bash\n# Verify that all paths referenced in .cypilot-adapter/pr-review.json exist.\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nimport os\n\ncfg_path = \".cypilot-adapter/pr-review.json\"\n\n# First check if the config file exists\nif not os.path.exists(cfg_path):\n    print(f\"Config file {cfg_path} does not exist\")\n    exit(1)\n\nwith open(cfg_path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    cfg = json.load(f)\n\npaths = []\nfor k in (\"scriptPath\", \"dataDir\", \"templatesDir\"):\n    v = cfg.get(k)\n    if v:\n        paths.append(v)\n\nfor prompt in cfg.get(\"prompts\", []):\n    for k in (\n        \"promptFile\",\n        \"checklist\",\n        \"coding_guidelines\",\n        \"security_guidelines\",\n        \"template\",\n        \"architecture\",\n        \"existing_artifacts\",\n        \"project_domain\",\n    ):\n        v = prompt.get(k)\n        if v:\n            paths.append(v)\n\nprint(\"Checking paths:\")\nmissing = []\nexisting = []\nfor p in sorted(set(paths)):\n    if os.path.exists(p):\n        existing.append(p)\n        print(f\"✓ {p}\")\n    else:\n        missing.append(p)\n        print(f\"✗ {p}\")\n\nprint()\nif missing:\n    print(\"Missing paths:\")\n    for m in missing:\n        print(f\" - {m}\")\nelse:\n    print(\"All referenced paths exist.\")\nPY\n```\n\nRepository: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core\n\nLength of output: 888\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**Create missing configuration dependencies or update references.**\n\nThe config references 8 paths that do not exist and will cause the PR review pipeline to fail at runtime:\n- `.cypilot/skills/scripts/pr.py` (script)\n- `.cypilot/prompts/pr/code-review.md`, `design-review.md`, `adr-review.md`, `prd-review.md` (prompts)\n- `.cypilot/templates/pr` (templates directory)\n- `docs/prds/` (directory)\n- `guidelines/DNA/languages/RUST.md` (guidelines)\n\nEither create these files/directories or update the config with correct paths that exist in the repository.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn @.cypilot-adapter/pr-review.json around lines 1 - 37, The PR config\nreferences missing resources (scriptPath, templatesDir, prompts.promptFile\nentries, prompts.template/existing_artifacts and coding_guidelines) that will\nbreak the review pipeline; either create the missing files/directories\n(.cypilot/skills/scripts/pr.py, .cypilot/prompts/pr/*.md,\n.cypilot/templates/pr/, docs/prds/, guidelines/DNA/languages/RUST.md) with\nappropriate content or update the JSON entries (scriptPath,\nprompts[*].promptFile, prompts[*].template, prompts[*].existing_artifacts,\ntemplatesDir, coding_guidelines) to point to existing, correct paths in the repo\nso the pipeline can find the referenced artifacts.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:eagle -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-02-11T19:13:56Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T19:23:00Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/565#discussion_r2795014104","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/565","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2795014104"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/565#discussion_r2795014104"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/565"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2795014104/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":1,"original_start_line":1,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":37,"original_line":37,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":37,"position":37,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2795051761","pull_request_review_id":3786828685,"id":2795051761,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6mmRrx","diff_hunk":"@@ -128,7 +129,35 @@ Generate draft content for missing CRITICAL items.\n \n ---\n \n+## PR Review Integration\n+\n+These checklists are integrated with the Cypilot PR review workflow. When reviewing PRs:\n+\n+- **PRD PRs**: Use `PRD.md` — covers requirements completeness, testability, traceability, and industry alignment\n+- **Design PRs**: Use `DESIGN.md` — covers architecture, trade-offs, API contracts, security, and antipatterns\n+- **ADR PRs**: Use `ADR.md` — covers decision significance, alternatives analysis, and overlap detection\n+- **Code PRs**: Use `CODING.md` — covers Rust correctness, architecture (ModKit/SDK pattern), security (secure ORM), clippy/dylint compliance, testing, performance, etc.\n+\n+The checklist is auto-selected by the `/cypilot-pr-review` workflow based on the PR content. Configuration is in `.cypilot/.cypilot-config.json` under the `pr.prompts` key.\n+\n+Example prompts:\n+\n+```\n+cypilot review PR 123\n+cypilot review PR #59 with CODE checklist\n+review PR 42\n+```\n+\n+---\n+\n ## Cross-References\n \n - Existing project docs (architecture docs, API specs, runbooks)\n - Source code and tests\n+- Cypilot PR review config: `.cypilot-adapter/pr-review.json`","path":"docs/checklists/README.md","commit_id":"1015089615b358bed96ea9838cb338de769d4bd2","original_commit_id":"03d3f713a0aff58901520cc648c97d5f5bb7fbcd","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.gith