es**\n  * API routes can be nested under a configurable prefix (defaults to \"/chat\"); endpoints and OpenAPI now reflect the base path.\n\n* **Configuration**\n  * Added a prefix option for the API Gateway with default \"/chat\".\n  * Default OpenAPI URL updated to use the prefixed path.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * End-to-end and integration tests updated to target the new prefixed routes.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-02-11T04:04:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T02:22:01Z","closed_at":"2026-02-13T02:22:01Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c80013481772711c0120cee3d20f44082ce5115a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"MikeFalcon77","id":3686170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYxNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3686170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeFalcon77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"Bechma","id":19294519,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5Mjk0NTE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19294519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma","html_url":"https://github.com/Bechma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com