rce_state":"closed","source_author":"github-actions[bot]","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #550] chore: release","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"release-plz-2026-02-10T21-42-24Z","pr_head_sha":"3aea44bb5bc28c3ae44a6c7b38aa6b6abc732a8a","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"cyberfabric","pr_from_fork":0,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/550","id":3269164985,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPaLyBs7C23-5","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/550","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/550.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/550.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/550","number":550,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore: release","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `cf-modkit-security`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-modkit-transport-grpc`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-system-sdk-directory`: 0.1.8\n* `cf-system-sdks`: 0.1.8\n* `cf-modkit-db-macros`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-modkit-errors`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-modkit-errors-macro`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-modkit-odata`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-modkit-utils`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-modkit-db`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-modkit-macros`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-modkit-odata-macros`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-modkit-sdk`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-modkit`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-modkit-http`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-modkit-auth`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-api-gateway`: 0.1.2\n* `cf-grpc-hub`: 0.1.2\n* `cf-types-registry-sdk`: 0.1.2\n* `types-sdk`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-file-parser`: 0.1.2\n* `cf-module-orchestrator`: 0.1.2\n* `cf-modkit-node-info`: 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4\n* `cf-nodes-registry-sdk`: 0.1.2\n* `cf-nodes-registry`: 0.1.2\n* `cf-tenant-resolver-sdk`: 0.1.3\n* `cf-single-tenant-tr-plugin`: 0.1.2\n* `cf-static-tr-plugin`: 0.1.2\n* `cf-tenant-resolver-gw`: 0.1.2\n* `cf-types-registry`: 0.1.2\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n\n\n## `cf-system-sdk-directory`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.8](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-system-sdk-directory-v0.1.8) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Other\n\n- release (by @github-actions[bot]) - #546\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @github-actions[bot]\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-system-sdks`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.8](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-system-sdks-v0.1.8) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Other\n\n- release (by @github-actions[bot]) - #546\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @github-actions[bot]\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n## `cf-modkit`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.2.4](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/compare/cf-modkit-v0.2.3...cf-modkit-v0.2.4) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Added\n\n- *(modkit-http)* introduce HttpClient (hyper+tower), replace reqwest and harden JWKS handling (by @MikeFalcon77)\n\n### Fixed\n\n- update module names to use kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n- *(dylint/de1301)* allow proc-macro impl methods via visit_assoc_item (by @Artifizer)\n\n### Other\n\n- Merge branch 'main' into shutdown-nl (by @Artifizer) - #475\n- Merge branch 'main' into rescue-docs-standards (by @Artifizer) - #478\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @yoskini\n* @MikeFalcon77\n* @Artifizer\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-modkit-http`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.2.4](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/compare/cf-modkit-http-v0.2.3...cf-modkit-http-v0.2.4) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Added\n\n- *(modkit-auth)* add outbound OAuth2 client-credentials token + bearer auth layer (by @MikeFalcon77)\n- *(modkit-http)* introduce HttpClient (hyper+tower), replace reqwest and harden JWKS handling (by @MikeFalcon77)\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @MikeFalcon77\n</blockquote>\n\n\n## `cf-api-gateway`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.2](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-api-gateway-v0.1.2) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Fixed\n\n- update module names to use kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @yoskini\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-grpc-hub`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.2](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-grpc-hub-v0.1.2) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Fixed\n\n- update module names to use kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @yoskini\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-types-registry-sdk`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.2](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-types-registry-sdk-v0.1.2) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Fixed\n\n- update module names to use kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @yoskini\n</blockquote>\n\n## `types-sdk`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.2.4](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/compare/types-sdk-v0.2.3...types-sdk-v0.2.4) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Other\n\n- update Cargo.toml dependencies\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-file-parser`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.2](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-file-parser-v0.1.2) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Fixed\n\n- update module names to use kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Other\n\n- update operation IDs and module names to kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @yoskini\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-module-orchestrator`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.2](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-module-orchestrator-v0.1.2) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Fixed\n\n- update module names to use kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @yoskini\n</blockquote>\n\n\n## `cf-nodes-registry-sdk`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.2](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-nodes-registry-sdk-v0.1.2) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Fixed\n\n- update module names to use kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @yoskini\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-nodes-registry`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.2](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-nodes-registry-v0.1.2) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Fixed\n\n- update module names to use kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Other\n\n- update operation IDs and module names to kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @yoskini\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-tenant-resolver-sdk`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.3](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-tenant-resolver-sdk-v0.1.3) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Fixed\n\n- update module names to use kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @yoskini\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-single-tenant-tr-plugin`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.2](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-single-tenant-tr-plugin-v0.1.2) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Fixed\n\n- update module names to use kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @yoskini\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-static-tr-plugin`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.2](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-static-tr-plugin-v0.1.2) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Fixed\n\n- update module names to use kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @yoskini\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-tenant-resolver-gw`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.2](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-tenant-resolver-gw-v0.1.2) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Fixed\n\n- update module names to use kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @yoskini\n</blockquote>\n\n## `cf-types-registry`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.1.2](https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/releases/tag/cf-types-registry-v0.1.2) - 2026-02-10\n\n### Fixed\n\n- update module names to use kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Other\n\n- update operation IDs and module names to kebab-case convention (by @yoskini) - #459\n\n### Contributors\n\n* @yoskini\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-02-10T21:42:26Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T09:36:44Z","closed_at":"2026-02-11T09:36:44Z","merged_at":"2026-02-11T09:36:44Z","merge_commit_sha":"d596a2c84aea90df31924840ae43a4ac8e2a4182","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":10069720360,"node_id":"LA_kwDOPaLyBs8AAAACWDO9KA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/labels/release-plz","name":"release-plz","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/550/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/550/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/550/comm