d`. This PR covers the remaining documentation files.\n\nRelates to #68\nFollow-up to #451\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added comprehensive guidance for a new domain-model annotation, its usage, constraints, and examples.\n  * Updated templates and checklists to require annotating domain-layer types and show examples for errors, events, service config, service construction, and local clients.\n  * Expanded allowed/forbidden types, compile-time error examples, CI enforcement notes, and manifest/README entries to reflect the change.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-02-10T17:11:32Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T18:57:23Z","closed_at":"2026-02-10T18:57:23Z","merged_at":"2026-02-10T18:57:23Z","merge_commit_sha":"c05c63b44a32dbd7f1a4a0167dab1b2b2ed3e58a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/543/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/543/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/543/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/98044f5d40b0365fca5ff7ff44047843ab22de54","head":{"label":"KvizadSaderah:docs/domain-model-attribute-docs","ref":"docs/domain-model-attribute-docs","sha":"98044f5d40b0365fca5ff7ff44047843ab22de54","user":{"login":"KvizadSaderah","id":14391797,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzkxNzk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14391797?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KvizadSaderah","html_url":"https://github.com/KvizadSaderah","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KvizadSad