_of_process\r\n4. includes_running_instances_with_grpc_services\r\n5. compiled_in_module_overridden_to_external\r\n6. dynamic_instances_without_catalog_entry\r\n7. plugins_field_omitted_when_empty\r\n8. version_omitted_when_no_instances\r\n9. modules_are_sorted_alphabetically\r\n\r\nCoverage (unit + e2e, measured with cargo-llvm-cov): 97.4% line coverage across API code (domain/service.rs 100%, handlers.rs 100%, routes.rs 90.3%, dto.rs 85.7%).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3881026914/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3895684146","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/540#issuecomment-3895684146","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/540","id":3895684146,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPaLyBs7oM2wy","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","receive