.com/users/KvizadSaderah/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KvizadSaderah/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KvizadSaderah/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KvizadSaderah/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`types-registry` already follows the same pattern — `capabilities = [system, rest]`, where the primary purpose is GTS infrastructure and REST is secondary for exposing data externally. `module-orchestrator` follows the same approach: primary = service discovery (gRPC), secondary = module listing (REST).\n\nThat said, if you'd prefer extracting the REST endpoint into a separate module, we can do that in a follow-up.","created_at":"2026-02-13T11:15:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T11:15:48Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/540#discussion_r2803694179","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/540","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2803694179"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/540#discussion_r2803694179"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/540"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2803694179/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":12,"original_line":53,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2801448282,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":53,"position":12,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2803694927","pull_request_review_id":3796713176,"id":2803694927,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6nHP1P","diff_hunk":"@@ -28,11 +36,15 @@ impl SystemContext {\n         instance_id: Uuid,\n         module_m