y coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Outbound OAuth2 client‑credentials with background refresh, token handle, and Authorization: Bearer injection; optional OIDC discovery and HTTP client extension to install auth layers.\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated architecture manifest, ADRs, design and implementation docs for HTTP client and OAuth2 flows; added usage example.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Centralized HTTP error formatting and improved error mapping for clearer, safer messages.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added security/token‑lifecycle dependencies and a SecretString type with automatic zeroization.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-02-10T00:07:23Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T19:53:01Z","closed_at":"2026-02-10T19:52:54Z","merged_at":"2026-02-10T19:52:53Z","merge_commit_sha":"425e2ebc1acf68959352d3f5527a728fa3310389","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/535/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/535/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/535/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/4498f35da206c75bcd6f33785fa0327d9533d6bb","head":{"label":"MikeFalcon77:feature/263-modkit-auth-phase0-1","ref":"feature/263-modkit-auth-phase0-1","sha":"4498f35da206c75bcd6f33785fa0327d9533d6bb","user":{"login":"MikeFalcon77","id":3686170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYxNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3686170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeFalcon77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/fo