iptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qodo-code-review%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-09T10:27:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T10:27:48Z","body":"<h3>Review Summary by Qodo</h3>\n\nOAGW design enhancements: phased feature breakdown, custom header routing, and enable/disable semantics\n\n<code>✨ Enhancement</code> <code>📝 Documentation</code>\n\n<img src=\"https://www.qodo.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/light-grey-line.svg\" height=\"10%\" alt=\"Grey Divider\">\n\n<h3>Walkthroughs</h3>\n\n<details open>\n<summary>Description</summary>\n\n<br/>\n\n<pre>\n• Add comprehensive feature breakdown by development phases (p0-p4) with 51 total features\n• Implement X-OAGW-Target-Host custom header routing for multi-endpoint upstream disambiguation\n• Add enable/disable semantics for upstreams and routes with hierarchical inheritance\n• Expand error handling with three new routing-specific error types and RFC 9457 compliance\n• Create 13 new scenario test cases covering custom header routing and enable/disable behaviors\n</pre>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Diagram</summary>\n\n<br/>\n\n>\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  A[\"OAGW Design\"] --> B[\"Feature Phases<br/>p0-p4: 51 features\"]\n  A --> C[\"X-OAGW-Target-Host<br/>Custom Header Routing\"]\n  A --> D[\"Enable/Disable<br/>Semantics\"]\n  A --> E[\"Error Types<br/>Routing Errors\"]\n  C --> F[\"Multi-endpoint<br/>Disambiguation\"]\n  C --> G[\"Format & Allowlist<br/>Validation\"]\n  D --> H[\"Upstream/Route<br/>Control\"]\n  D --> I[\"Hierarchical<br/>Inheritance\"]\n  E --> J[\"Missing/Invalid/<br/>Unknown Host\"]\n```\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://www.qodo.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/light-grey-line.svg\" height=\"10%\" alt=\"Grey Divider\">\n\n<h3>File Changes</h3>\n\n<details>\n<summary>1. modules/system/oagw/DESIGN.md\n <code>📝 Documentation</code> <code> +349/-53 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Comprehensive design updates with phased features and routing enhancements\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/527/files#diff-f4fdd5834a964c7cd99fdd61c8ca9d8366cf65565894c59f592ecc606d139760'> modules/system/oagw/DESIGN.md\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>2. modules/system/oagw/PRD.md\n <code>📝 Documentation</code> <code> +18/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Add enable/disable semantics section to product requirements\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/527/files#diff-bb1245bb0699cb8248aaefaebecad30b8dfa41c3c230af0a71e82f5129035ffd'> modules/system/oagw/PRD.md\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>3. modules/system/oagw/scenarios/INDEX.md\n <code>🧪 Tests</code> <code> +154/-5 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Add 13 new scenario test cases for custom header routing\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/527/files#diff-44307139cdaa663206189dca1b50a80f65f4d3007ee635772c217b12ea22a83b'> modules/system/oagw/scenarios/INDEX.md\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details><summary><ins><strong>View more (17)</strong></ins></summary><br/>\n<details>\n<summary>4. modules/system/oagw/scenarios/management-api/upstreams/positive-2.11-re-enable-upstream-restores-proxy-traffic.md\n <code>🧪 Tests</code> <code> +109/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Test scenario for re-enabling disabled upstream\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core/pull/527/files#diff-ef5e701b4b3adfdadce5651e42e2eb97b0e081d1e9ad5d2bfd43b71ee158df1a'> modules/system/oagw/scenarios/management-api/upstreams/positive-2.11-re-enable-upstream-restores-proxy-traffic.md\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>5. modules/system/