nmeans limit is approximation across nodes\"). Ensure the punctuation and\nsurrounding list formatting in adr-concurrency-control.md remains consistent\nafter the edits.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:triton:eagle -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-02-10T12:48:37Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T12:48:41Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/527#discussion_r2787767188","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/527","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2787767188"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/527#discussion_r2787767188"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/527"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2787767188/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":421,"original_start_line":421,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":424,"original_line":424,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":178,"position":178,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2787767213","pull_request_review_id":3778753151,"id":2787767213,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6mKfOt","diff_hunk":"@@ -233,6 +237,9 @@ Node 1: Uses tokens locally, requests more when low\n \n ## Decision Outcome\n \n+**Component Architecture Note**: Rate limiting executes in **Data Plane (CP)**. CP owns rate limiters per-instance for MVP. Configuration is resolved from Control Plane (DP) caches\n+during upstream/route resolution. See [ADR: State Management](./adr-state-management.md) for component responsibilities.","path":"modules/system/oagw/docs/adr-rate-limiting.md","commit_id":"141f08c649b048bdf4b4c9e7add110efb09054c6","original_commit_id":"9f1410ff0