ing \"Data Plane (CP)\"\nso ownership reads consistently; adjust the sentence referencing \"ADR: State\nManagement\" only if needed to keep the mapping clear.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:triton:eagle -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-02-10T12:48:37Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T12:48:42Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/527#discussion_r2787767213","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/527","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2787767213"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/527#discussion_r2787767213"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/527"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2787767213/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":240,"original_start_line":240,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":241,"original_line":241,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":61,"position":61,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2787767218","pull_request_review_id":3778753151,"id":2787767218,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6mKfOy","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,95 @@\n+# ADR: Request Routing\n+\n+- **Status**: Accepted\n+- **Date**: 2026-02-09\n+- **Deciders**: OAGW Team\n+\n+## Context and Problem Statement\n+\n+With three components (API Handler, Data Plane, Control Plane), we need to define how requests are routed between them. Different request types have different requirements:\n+\n+- Management operations (CRUD for upstreams/routes/plugins) modify configuration\n+- Proxy operations execute calls to external services\n+\n+**Key Question**: Which component handles which operations?\n+\n+## Decision\n+\n+**Path-Based Routing**: API Handler routes requests based on URL path.\n+\n+### Routing Rules\n+\n+| Path Pattern               | Routed To     | Purpose        |\n+|----------------------------|---------------|----------------|\n+| `/api/oagw/v1/upstreams/*` | Control Plane    | Upstream CRUD  |\n+| `/api/oagw/v1/routes/*`    | Control Plane    | Route CRUD     |\n+| `/api/oagw/v1/plugins/*`   | Control Plane    | Plugin CRUD    |\n+| `/api/oagw/v1/proxy/*`     | Data Plane | Proxy requests |","path":"modules/system/oagw/docs/adr-request-routing.md","commit_id":"141f08c649b048bdf4b4c9e7add110efb09054c6","original_commit_id":"9f1410ff06eed7a636699d488d73f43928f784cf","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_\n\n**Inconsistency between routing table and rationale section.**\n\nThe routing table (lines 22-27) shows:\n- `/api/oagw/v1/upstreams/*` → **Control Plane**\n- `/api/oagw/v1/routes/*` → **Control Plane**\n- `/api/oagw/v1/plugins/*` → **Control Plane**\n\nBut the rationale section (lines 55-60) states:\n- \"**Why DP handles management operations**\"\n- \"DP owns configuration data and database access\"\n\nThis is contradictory. If Control Plane handles management paths per the routing table, the rationale should say \"Why **CP** handles management operations.\"\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>✍️ Suggested fix</summary>\n\nEither update the routing table to route management operations to Data Plane (DP), or update the rationale to reflect that Control Plane (CP) handles them:\n\n```diff\n ## Rationale\n\n-**Why DP handles management operations**:\n+**Why CP handles management operations**:\n\n-- DP owns configuration data and database access\n+- CP owns configuration data and database access\n - Direct path: no need to go through CP\n-- DP can immediately invalidate caches after writes\n+- CP can immediately invalidate caches after writes\n - Shorter path reduces latency for config operations\n```\n\n</details>\n\n\nAlso applies to: 55-60\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@modules/system/oagw/docs/adr-request-routing.md` around lines 22 - 27, The\nrouting table entries `/api/oagw/v1/upstreams/*`, `/api/oagw/v1/routes/*`, and\n`/api/oagw/v1/plugins/*` currently state they route to \"Control Plane\" but the\nrationale section titled \"Why DP handles management operations\" claims the Data\nPlane owns configuration—make them consistent by either: (A) changing the\nrouting table entries to route those paths to \"Data Plane\" (if DP should own\nmanagement operations), or (B) updating the rationale heading and prose from\n\"Why DP handles management operations\" / \"DP owns configuration data and\ndatabase access\" to instead state that the Control Plane (CP) handles management\noperations and owns configuration, ensuring the terms \"Control Plane\" or \"Data\nPlane\" are used consistently across the routing table and the rationale section.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:ocelot -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-02-10T12:48:37Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T12:48:42Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/527#discussion_r2787767218","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/527","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2787767218"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/527#discussion_r2787767218"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/527"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2787767218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":22,"original_start_line":22,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":27,"original_line":27,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":27,"position":27,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2787767223","pull_request_review_id":3778753151,"id":2787767223,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6mKfO3","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@\n+[package]\n+name = \"cf-oagw-dp\"\n+version.workspace = true\n+edition.workspace = true\n+description = \"Control Plane implementation - configuration management and caching\"","path":"modules/system/oagw/oagw-dp/Cargo.toml","commit_id":"141f08c649b048bdf4b4c9e7add110efb09054c6","original_commit_id":"9f1410ff06eed7a636699d488d73f43928f784cf","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","