ent.\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Suggested improvement</summary>\n\n```diff\n-**1. API Handler (`oagw-api`)**\n+**1. API Handler (`oagw-api`)**\n\n-**Responsibility**: Entry point for all HTTP requests\n+**Responsibility**: Entry point for all HTTP requests\n-**Functions**:\n+**Functions**:\n```\n\nOr add `text` as the language identifier if this is meant to be plain text.\n\n</details>\n\nBased on learnings: Static analysis tool markdownlint-cli2 flagged fenced code blocks that should have a language specified.\n\n---\n\n`70-79`: **Minor: Missing language identifier for module structure diagram.**\n\nThe module structure would render better with a language identifier (e.g., `text` or `plaintext`) for the code fence.\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n ### Module Structure\n \n-```\n+```text\n modules/system/oagw/\n```\n\n</details>\n\nBased on learnings: Static analysis tool markdownlint-cli2 flagged fenced code blocks that should have a language specified (MD040).\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>modules/system/oagw/docs/adr-circuit-breaker.md (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`242-247`: **Minor: Missing language identifier for code fence.**\n\nThe \"Pros:\" section uses a fenced code block that would benefit from a language identifier for proper rendering.\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n **Pros**:\n-\n+```text\n - Strong consistency across nodes\n - Atomic operations via Lua scripts\n - Fast (<1ms latency)\n - Supports distributed counters\n+```\n```\n\nNote: If this isn't meant to be a code block, consider using a regular bulleted list instead.\n\n</details>\n\nBased on learnings: Static analysis tool markdownlint-cli2 flagged line 245 for missing language specification (MD040).\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>modules/system/oagw/docs/adr-rust-abi-client-library.md (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`887-945`: **Avoid external network dependencies in tests.**\n\nThe example test